# Overlay: the lossless trunk option.
# The same routed experts as the default full quant; attention, shared experts and KV cache stay BF16,
# as Tencent ships them. Nothing else changes, including drafts (DFly2 still runs from its 4-bit files
# in trunk-4b/; drafted text can still differ from plain text at a close call, as on the full quant).
#
# Usage (after your base ring.env):
#   bash launch/launch.sh --env-file launch/ring.env --env-file launch/ring.lossless.env.example
#
# To serve the lossless trunk without drafts as well, also set SERVE_DRAFTS="0" here.

TF_HY4_TRUNK=""
